<title>UK: UK meals and feeds start week steadier, but quiet.</title>
<headline>UK meals and feeds start week steadier, but quiet.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported very little interest on the UK meals and feeds market on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;It's started where it left off last week, very quiet with buyers showing virtually no interest,&quot; said one broker.</p>
<p>Higher protein soymeal offers were unchanged to 1.50 stg up while the remainder of the market was unchanged. --Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
